WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:01.900
Hi, I'm Bonet.

2
00:00:02.160 --> 00:00:04.167
Practice at home doesn't have to be big.

3
00:00:04.427 --> 00:00:05.745
A little, every day.

4
00:00:06.500 --> 00:00:08.274
Pick a move and tap Start.

5
00:00:08.534 --> 00:00:10.530
The camera counts every rep for you.

6
00:00:10.790 --> 00:00:13.805
Could you go a little higher? It will tell you, kindly.

7
00:00:15.500 --> 00:00:17.197
When you're done, see how it went.

8
00:00:17.457 --> 00:00:20.177
Six small things, drawn as one picture.

9
00:00:20.437 --> 00:00:22.915
And one tip for next time.

10
00:00:23.667 --> 00:00:26.637
Now let's talk. Tap the words to build a sentence.

11
00:00:26.897 --> 00:00:28.346
Then say it out loud.

12
00:00:28.606 --> 00:00:30.434
Stuck? Ask for a hint.

13
00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:33.142
Time for a brain game.

14
00:00:33.402 --> 00:00:35.481
Flip the cards and find the pairs.

15
00:00:37.667 --> 00:00:39.794
Come back tomorrow and keep your streak going.

16
00:00:40.054 --> 00:00:41.734
Join the weekly league, if you like.

17
00:00:41.994 --> 00:00:43.410
And pick new outfits for me!

18
00:00:44.667 --> 00:00:46.890
See how your practice went, week by week.

19
00:00:47.150 --> 00:00:49.875
Then share a one-page report with your therapist or family.

20
00:00:51.000 --> 00:00:53.414
Bonet. Free to start.

21
00:00:53.674 --> 00:00:55.904
A little practice, every day.

